    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem erdos_25 : answer(sorry) ↔\n    ∀ (seq_n : ℕ → ℕ) (seq_a : ℕ → ℤ), (∀ i, 0 < seq_n i) → StrictMono seq_n →\n      ∃ d, Set.HasLogDensity\n        { x : ℕ | ∀ i, (x : ℤ) < seq_n i ∨ ¬((x : ℤ) ≡ seq_a i [ZMOD seq_n i]) } d",
